7. Create `src/components/contentstack/ContentstackQuote/ContentstackQuote.tsx` — implement a presentational component that renders a Contentstack quote block (quote text, author, and optional citation) and accepts `ContentstackAddPreviewButton`-compatible props for inline editing in preview mode.

8. Modify `src/components/contentstack/ContentStackGallery/ContentStackGallery.tsx`, `src/components/contentstack/ContentStackStaticMaps/ContentStackStaticMaps.tsx`, and `src/components/contentstack/ContentStackVideoPlayer/ContentStackVideoPlayer.tsx` — wrap each component's root element with Contentstack live preview editable annotations (using `data-cslp` attributes or the SDK's `addEditableTags` helper) so individual fields are highlighted and editable in the CMS preview pane.

9. Modify `.env.local` and `.env.local.sample` — add `CONTENTSTACK_LIVE_PREVIEW_HOST` (e.g., `https://api.contentstack.io` or regional host) and `CONTENTSTACK_PREVIEW_TOKEN` variables with appropriate sample values and inline comments.

